\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Lord do to me as you prefer\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In my life time or in death.
\par I look out only for your love
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And live me not in my sins.
\par In time of pains, give me patience,
\par Let me be guided by your grace;
\par Your will is so good for me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Let your good news be sweet to me
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that I may tell you the truth.
\par let me do whatever you like
\par that satan may not get me
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me follow your commandments,
\par and let my lifestyle be like yours,
\par through out my life on this earth.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Someday to come if you meet me
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 from this earth to your Kingdom.
\par Let me with joy and happiness
\par listen to thy call and come.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I, with my soul and my body
\par into thy hands, my God I give
\par take me as yours for ever.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

